^n  QWK Mail Reader Message Reset menu
^n [0] Reset to 0 (all new)
^n [1] Reset to newest number (all old)
^n [2] Reset to beginning of previous call
^n [3] Reset to last read pointers from BBS
^n [4] Reset to newest number - inputed valued
^n [H]elp with message reset
^n [Q]uit QWK Mail Reader reset menu
^n RESET MENU [0 1 2 3 4 H Q]:^s
